{
  "$comment": [
    "THE SINGLE SOURCE OF TRUTH FOR THE WORDS THIS APP USES.",
    "",
    "docs/STYLE_GUIDE.md explains the rules in prose; this file is the machine-readable",
    "half, and scripts/verifyCopy.mjs fails the build on anything that contradicts it.",
    "Change a decision here and the lint follows on the next run — that is the point.",
    "",
    "Credential names are deliberately NOT listed here. They live in",
    "src/data/credentials/*.js as `officialName`, which is where the issuer's exact",
    "capitalization already has to be right, and duplicating 37 of them into a second",
    "file is how the two files start disagreeing."
  ],
